<Page title="Terms: SatsRecord" heading="Terms." intro="Placeholder. Terms of service follow once pilot agreements are drafted.">
  <h2>What SatsRecord is</h2>
  <p>Software that issues bitcoin addresses from a public key you provide, records donations paid to them, values them at block time and sends acknowledgements. It never holds a key that can sign and never takes custody of funds.</p>
  <h2>What it is not</h2>
  <p>Not a money transmitter, exchange, custodian or payment processor. Not tax advice: valuations record a stated source and method for your accountant to rely on or replace.</p>
  <h2>Open source</h2>
  <p>The application is released under AGPL-3.0 and the embeddable widget under MIT.</p>
</Page>
